{"id":"firma","lemma":"firma","pos":"noun","rank":1348,"glosses":["signature","seal","company"],"ipa":"/ˈfiɾma/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"firmas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-firma.wav","examples":[{"text":"Firma aquí, por favor.","en":"Sign here, please.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39668"},{"text":"Es una firma acreditada.","en":"It's a solvent firm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770118"},{"text":"Firma sobre esta línea.","en":"Sign above this line.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/633205"},{"text":"Necesito tu firma aquí.","en":"I need your signature here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78031"},{"text":"Necesito su firma aquí.","en":"I need your signature here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78032"}]}